ckerValue"},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-21","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#daterangepickervalue","content":"DateRangePickerValue"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-22","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-23","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"716":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-24","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"},"717":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-25","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"},"718":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-26","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features",