d"],[534,"❌ For mutually exclusive options (use Radio instead)"],[1831,"❌ For selections that require a \"Save\" or \"Submit\" action (use `Checkbox` instead)"],[535,"❌ For simple on/off toggles without labels (use Toggle/Switch instead)"],[2102,"❌ For unrelated actions that perform disconnected tasks without shared context"],[2104,"❌ When actions require strong visual distinction (e.g. Save vs. Delete)"],[2105,"❌ When selecting an option leads to a different page or workflow — use navigation instead"],[1550,"❌ When space is limited (use Select dropdown)"],[328,"🚧 Additional customization options (tick formatting, axis configuration)"],[326,"🚧 RTL compatibility (axis rendering and spacing refinement)"],[327,"🚧 Tick mark positioning improvements"],[1022,"A `<Button slot=\"trigger\">` gets `aria-expanded` + `aria-controls` wired to the `InlineDrawerPanel` automatically (via RAC Disclosure)."],[765,"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`; otherwise pass `aria-label`"],[1391,"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`. Without one, a popover inside\na `PopoverTrigger` falls back to being labelled by its trigger; standing alone with\n`triggerRef` it needs an explicit `aria-label`"],[1219,"A `Menu` is a collection, so it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger` children. Rich content inside a `Menu`\nor submenu is not supported. To show a `Calendar`, let the item close the\nmenu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored to the trigger\nwith `triggerRef`."],[1231,"A `Menu` is a collection: it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger`. For rich content (a `Calendar`, a form),\nclose the menu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored with\n`triggerRef` instead of putting it in a submenu."],[1218,"A `MenuGroup` with `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` renders its items as checkboxes.\nDrive the checked items with `selectedKeys` + `onSel